message: "If you use Paper to Plate in research, please cite the software and the original methods behind your experiment."
type: software
title: "Paper to Plate: Literature-Guided Agents for Physical Experiments"
authors:
  - name: "Ursa Labs"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ursa-Laboratories/PaperToPlate"
