abstract: >-
  A research prototype connecting Valency Bond literature retrieval,
  AI-assisted experiment design, deterministic liquid-handling compilation,
  CubOS execution, and recorded laboratory evidence.
keywords:
  - laboratory automation
  - scientific agents
